    {
      "id": "fa436b80",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "创建一个行矩阵`b`，其中包含对以下表达式进行求值的结果：$\\sqrt{2}$、$3\\pi$、$9/11$以及$1.001^{1000}$，且顺序必须完全一致。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
