          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ebe8126d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "要对两个长度相同的数组进行添加，虽然元素级添加语法`.+`同样有效，但使用`+`运算符以常规方式进行添加更为简便。数组减法也是如此。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49be02e2",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "z = x + y"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b5359510",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "w = x - y"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
