      "id": "4e166ada",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n`* `运算符执行**矩阵乘法**。要使该操作生效，第一个矩阵的列数必须等于第二个矩阵的行数。否则，将无法进行矩阵乘法。\n\n示例。让我们将矩阵$A=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}$与列向量$B=\\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\\\ 6 \\end{pmatrix}$相乘。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0c38b070",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "A = [1 2; 3 4]\r\nB = [5; 6]\r\nA * B"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
