    {
      "id": "48b17ed9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 重塑数组\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0c81d8b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `reshape(A, dims...)`是一个数组，其中包含与`A`相同的数据，但维度不同；\n* `transpose(A)`将数组`A`转置；\n* `cat(A..., dims)`沿`dims`中指定的维度对输入数组进行拼接。若`dims=1`，则等同于`vcat`；若`dims=2`，则等同于`hcat`；\n* `vcat(A...)`对数组或数值进行垂直拼接。等同于`cat(A...; dims=1)`；\n* `hcat(A...)`执行数组或数字的垂直拼接。等同于`cat(A...; dims=2)`；\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a2d78304",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "示例。让我们定义一个包含$16$个元素的一维数组，并使用`reshape`函数将其大小更改为二维，包含$2$行和$8$列。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14873835",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = [1:16;]"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
