    },
    {
      "id": "5f7d3970",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `sum(A)` – 计算数组的元素之和`A`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
