          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6cdb1b6e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `sum(A, dims=n)` – 按列（若`dims=1`）或按行（若`dims=2`）对二维数组`A`的元素进行求和。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
